url": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/detective-conan/episodes/4107398"}, {"title": "detektiv conan shinichi ran liebesgestaendnis london episode 621,3447320", "url": "https://www.gamepro.de/artikel/detektiv-conan-shinichi-ran-liebesgestaendnis-london-episode-621,3447320.html"}, {"title": "meitantei conan 2011 05 21 homuzuno mo shi lu ming tan zhenno di zi", "url": "https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/329769/meitantei-conan-2011-05-21-homuzuno-mo-shi-lu-ming-tan-zhenno-di-zi"}, {"title": "meitantei conan 2011 06 04 holmes revelation satan", "url": "https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/329771/meitantei-conan-2011-06-04-holmes-revelation-satan"}]}, "The search doesn't support the premise exactly. In the episode, Big Ben is where Shinichi's location is revealed, and the confession runs the other way.\n\n- **Big Ben:** During a phone call, Conan (using Shinichi's voice) explains that a riddle refers to Big Ben, and that slip gives away that he is in London. Conan tells Ran the first riddle \"A rolling bell rises me\", refers to Big Ben and accidentally reveals he is in London.\n- **The confrontation:** Ran works out where he is and goes looking. Conan becomes cornered in a phone booth and is forced to take the antidote, APTX 4869, for the return trip and confronts Ran as Shinichi.\n- **The confession:** Ran does the confessing, not Shinichi. Ran confesses her pain of liking Shinichi who is indifferent to her feelings and runs away as is left chasing after her.\n- **Significance:** One German article calls this episode 621, titled \"Holmes Offenbarung - 0 is Start\", the first real love confession, which fans had waited more than 15 years to see.\n\nThe arc is the London case from the Holmes' Revelation storyline. It aired in 2011 as part of the anime. The sources I found don't describe Shinichi confessing to Ran at Big Ben, so that detail may be a mix-up with this scene."], "durationSeconds": 6.633353541000004, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01WYrJAQWtUrHE